#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_agent.rst:89
msgid ""
"Agent name/alias. By default, machine's ``hostname`` will be used. You can "
"use this name later for :ref:`cmd_remote_device` and :ref:`cmd_remote_run` "
"commands. Good names are home, office, lab or etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/remote/cmd_agent.rst:96
